# Input-size study embedding arrays: 36 MB of .npz regenerated by
# `input_size_embed`. The digests that every table reads — embed_stats.json and
# eval_summary.json — are committed alongside; the arrays themselves are not.
reports/clip-culling/input-size/npz/

